      "id": "9e4bcaaf-eff0-4b9f-a86b-1cd1f6a68408",
      "name": "Tags",
      "description": {
        "content": "Tags are part of your *ERP* **Masterdata**, and represent business\ncategories that are associated with certain entities, like Vendor.\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
