            "description": {
              "content": "Get a list of tags.\nTags are used to categorize entities. Currently the only entity that is\ntaggable are Vendors using the `/vendorTags` endpoint. These are not the\ntags that are used to describe a group of companies.\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
